Hi,
I'm having an issue when trying to save entity with ManyToMany relationship

My tables:
```sql
CREATE TABLE DB.students (
    student_id integer NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE DB.courses (
    course_id integer NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE DB.students_to_courses (
    student_id integer NOT NULL,
    course_id integer NOT NULL
);
```

My Entities:
```ts
@Entity('students')
export default class Student extends BaseEntity {
	@PrimaryGeneratedColumn({
		name: 'student_id'
	})
	id: number;

	@ManyToMany(type => Course)
	@JoinTable({
		name: 'students_to_courses',
		joinColumn: { name: 'student_id' },
		inverseJoinColumn: { name: 'course_id' }
	})
	courses: Course[];

	@OneToMany(type => StudentToCourse, stc => stc.studentID)
	studentToCourses: StudentToCourse[];
}
```


```ts
@Entity('courses')
export default class Course extends BaseEntity {
	@PrimaryGeneratedColumn({
		name: 'course_id'
	})
	id: number;
}
```



```ts
@Entity('students_to_courses')
export default class StudentToCourse extends BaseEntity {
	@PrimaryColumn({
		name: 'student_id'
	})
	studentID: number;

	@PrimaryColumn({
		name: 'course_id'
	})
	courseID: number;
}
```

When I run this command:
```ts
await student.save();
```

I'm getting this error:
```
ERROR:  missing FROM-clause entry for table "student_courses_rid"
```

The query that its generating:
```sql
SELECT Student_courses_rid.course_id AS "course_id", Student_courses_rid.student_id AS "student_id"
FROM "public"."courses" "courses" INNER JOIN "public"."students_to_courses" "Student_courses_rid"
ON (Student_courses_rid.student_id = $1 AND Student_courses_rid.course_id = "courses"."course_id")
ORDER BY Student_courses_rid.course_id ASC, Student_courses_rid.student_id ASC
```

Created a demo in [this repository](https://github.com/oyakovVonage/typeorm-bug)

