**Steps to reproduce or a small repository showing the problem:**

I am having an issue with a TypeORM generated query dealing with a ManyToMany relationship between my Documents and Groups. The issue seems to be caused by having a DocumentGroupXref entity defined and registered with TypeORM that maps to document_group_xref, which is the joining table between Document and Group.

```ts
@Entity('document_group_xref')
export class DocumentGroupXref {
  @PrimaryColumn({ name: 'document_id' })
  documentId: number;

  @PrimaryColumn({ name: 'group_id' })
  groupId: number;

  @Column({ name: 'assigned_dt' })
  assignedDate: Date;

  @ManyToOne(() => Group)
  @JoinColumn({ name: 'group_id' })
  group: Group;
}
```

However, in my Document entity, I don't use the `DocumentGroupXref` entity directly, and just reference the document_group_xref table directly in the JoinTable decorator. The reason for the `DocumentGroupXref` entity is so that I can directly manipulate the `Group`s for a specific `Document` in a nested controller under the `Document` controller using `@nestjsx/crud`.

```ts
@Entity('document')
export class Document {
  @PrimaryGeneratedColumn({ name: 'id' })
  id: number;

  @ManyToMany(() => Group)
  @JoinTable({
    name: 'document_group_xref',
    joinColumn: { name: 'document_id' },
    inverseJoinColumn: { name: 'group_id' }
  })
  groups: Group[];
}
```

When I try to delete an entire Document I get an error saying that document_groups_rid is missing from the query. Obviously, this is a quoting issue with Postgres, but the query is being generated without quotes, while the rest of the query is quoted properly. As soon as I remove DocumentGroupXref from the @Module import (NestJS), the deletion works fine and the query is generated properly with quotes.

![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/479560/82939908-048a3800-9f62-11ea-96c7-480e7520820a.png)

This issue also pops up when I am updating the Document. This seems to be thrown in calling `repo.save`.

