I have 3 tables and 2 entity, like below:
```sql
CREATE TABLE "public"."item_items_sub_categories" (
    "id" varchar NOT NULL,
    "itemId" varchar NOT NULL,
    "subcategoryId" varchar NOT NULL,
    PRIMARY KEY ("id")
);

CREATE TABLE "public"."item_items" (
    "id" varchar NOT NULL,
);

CREATE TABLE "public"."item_subcategories" (
    "id" varchar NOT NULL,
);
```
```typescript
@Entity('item_items')
export class ItemItem extends BaseEntity {
  @Column({primary: true})
  id: string;

  @ManyToMany(() => ItemSubcategory, subCategory => subCategory.items)
  @JoinTable({
    name: 'item_items_sub_categories',
    joinColumn: {
      name: 'itemId',
      referencedColumnName: 'id'
    },
    inverseJoinColumn: {
      name: 'subcategoryId',
      referencedColumnName: 'id'
    }
  })
  subCategories: Promise<ItemSubcategory[]> = Promise.resolve([]);
}

@Entity('item_subcategories')
export class ItemSubcategory extends BaseEntity {
  @Column({primary: true})
  id: string;

  @ManyToMany(() => ItemItem, item => item.subCategories)
  items: Promise<ItemItem[]>
}
```

then i query like below:

```typescript
ItemItem.find({
  relations: ['subCategories']
});
```

it throw error: `column ItemItem.itemId does not exist`.

the sql log like `SELECT DISTINCT "distinctAlias"."ItemItem_id" as "ids_ItemItem_id", "distinctAlias"."ItemItem_id" FROM (SELECT "ItemItem"."id" AS "ItemItem_id", "ItemItem__subCategories"."id" AS "ItemItem__subCategories_id", "ItemItem"."itemId" FROM "item_items" "ItemItem" LEFT JOIN "item_items_sub_categories" "ItemItem_ItemItem__subCategories" ON "ItemItem_ItemItem__subCategories"."itemId"="ItemItem"."id" LEFT JOIN "item_subcategories" "ItemItem__subCategories" ON "ItemItem__subCategories"."id"="ItemItem_ItemItem__subCategories"."subcategoryId") "distinctAlias"`
